egin="00:06.870" end="00:07.230">of </span><span begin="00:07.230" end="00:08.190">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:08.940" end="00:11.010"><span begin="00:08.940" end="00:09.570">Because </span><span begin="00:09.570" end="00:09.690">they </span><span begin="00:09.690" end="00:10.110">sleep </span><span begin="00:10.110" end="00:10.410">with </span><span begin="00:10.410" end="00:10.530">a </span><span begin="00:10.530" end="00:11.010">gun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.160" end="00:13.260"><span begin="00:11.160" end="00:11.460">And </span><span begin="00:11.460" end="00:11.820">keep </span><span begin="00:11.820" end="00:12.090">an </span><span begin="00:12.090" end="00:12.390">eye </span><span begin="00:12.390" end="00:12.630">on </span><span begin="00:12.630" end="00:12.780">you </span><span begin="00:12.780" end="00:13.260">son</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.260" end="00:17.130"><span begin="00:13.260" end="00:13.650">So </span><span begin="00:13.650" end="00:13.920">they </span><span begin="00:13.920" end="00:14.190">can </span><span begin="00:14.190" end="00:14.610">watch </span><span begin="00:14.610" end="00:14.790">all </span><span begin="00:14.790" end="00:14.940">the </span><span begin="00:14.940" end="00:15.660">things </span><span begin="00:15.660" end="00:16.080">you </span><span begin="00:16.080" end="00:17.130">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.760" end="00:19.980"><span begin="00:17.760" end="00:18.480">Because </span><span begin="00:18.480" end="00:18.630">the </span><span begin="00:18.630" end="00:19.050">drugs </span><span begin="00:19.050" end="00:19.500">never </span><span begin="00:19.500" end="00:19.980">work</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.010" end="00:22.080"><span begin="00:20.010" end="00:20.310">They're </span><span begin="00:20.310" end="00:20.880">gonna </span><span begin="00:20.880" end="00:21.210">give </span><span begin="00:21.210" end="00:21.510">you </span><span begin="00:21.510" end="00:21.630">a </span><span begin="00:21.630" end="00:22.080">smirk</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.170" end="00:26.040"><span begin="00:22.170" end="00:22.560">Cause </span><span begin="00:22.560" end="00:22.770">they </span><span begin="00:22.770" end="00:23.040">got </span><span begin="00:23.040" end="00:23.700">methods </span><span begin="00:23.700" end="00:23.820">of </span><span begin="00:23.820" end="00:24.390">keeping </span><span begin="00:24.390" end="00:24.870">you </span><span begin="00:24.870" end="00:26.040">clean</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.430" end="00:28.740"><span begin="00:26.430" end="00:26.820">They </span><span begin="00:26.820" end="00:27.390">gonna </span><span begin="00:27.390" end="00:27.750">rip </span><span begin="00:27.750" end="00:27.990">up </span><span begin="00:27.990" end="00:28.260">your </span><span begin="00:28.260" end="00:28.740">head</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.740" end="00:31.050"><span begin="00:28.740" end="00:29.160">Your </span><span begin="00:29.160" end="00:30.210">aspirations </span><span begin="00:30.210" end="00:30.360">to </span><span begin="00:30.360" end="00:31.050">shreds</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.050" end="00:34.410"><span begin="00:31.050" end="00:31.710">Another </span><span begin="00:31.710" end="00:32.190">cog </span><span begin="00:32.190" end="00:32.370">in </span><span begin="00:32.370" end="00:32.550">the </span><span begin="00:32.550" end="00:33.360">murder </span><span begin="00:33.360" end="00:34.410">machine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.440" end="00:36.060"><span begin="00:34.440" end="00:34.860">They </span><span begin="00:34.860" end="00:35.760">say </span><span begin="00:35.760" end="00:36.060">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.060" end="00:39.720"><span begin="00:36.060" end="00:36.900">Teenagers </span><span begin="00:36.900" end="00:37.440">scare </span><span begin="00:37.440" end="00:37.740">the </span><span begin="00:37.740" end="00:38.640">living </span><span begin="00:38.640" end="00:38.640">*</span><span begin="00:38.640" end="00:38.640">*</span><span begin="00:38.640" end="00:38.640">*</span><span begin="00:38.640" end="00:38.640">* </span><span begin="00:38.640" end="00:39.090">outta </span><span begin="00:39.090" end="00:39.720">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.260" end="00:44.010"><span begin="00:40.260" end="00:40.680">They </span><span begin="00:40.680" end="00:40.920">could </span><span begin="00:40.920" end="00:41.250">care </span><span begin="00:41.250" end="00:41.850">less </span><span begin="00:41.850" end="00:42.090">as </span><span begin="00:42.090" end="00:42.390">long </span><span begin="00:42.390" end="00:42.510">as </span><span begin="00:42.510" end="00:43.350">someone'll </span><span begin="00:43.350" end="00:44.010">bleed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.310" end="00:46.020"><span begin="00:44.310" end="00:44.670">So </span><span begin="00:44.670" end="00:45.270">darken </span><span begin="00:45.270" end="00:45.450">your </span><span begin="00:45.450" end="00:46.020">clothes</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.050" end="00:48.180"><span begin="00:46.050" end="00:46.290">Or </span><span begin="00:46.290" end="00:46.680">strike </span><span begin="00:46.680" end="00:46.830">a </span><span begin="00:46.830" end="00:47.670">violent </span><span begin="00:47.670" end="00:48.180">pose</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.210" end="00:51.630"><span begin="00:48.210" end="00:48.780">Maybe </span><span begin="00:48.780" end="00:48.960">they'll </span><span begin="00:48.960" end="00:49.350">leave </span><span begin="00:49.350" end="00:49.620">you </span><span begin="00:49.620" end="00:50.250">alone</span><span begin="00:50.250" end="00:50.280">, </span><span begin="00:50.280" end="00:50.550">but </span><span begin="00:50.550" end="00:51.060">not </span><span begin="00:51.060" end="00:51.630">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.630" end="00:54.420"><span begin="00:51.630" end="00:52.170">The </span><span begin="00:52.170" end="00:52.860">boys </span><span begin="00:52.860" end="00:53.310">and </span><span begin="00:53.310" end="00:53.700">girls </span><span begin="00:53.700" end="00:53.940">in </span><span begin="00:53.940" end="00:54.030">the </span><span begin="00:54.030" end="00:54.420">clique</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.660" end="00:56.640"><span begin="00:54.660" end="00:55.020">The </span><span begin="00:55.020" end="00:55.410">awful </span><span begin="00:55.410" end="00:55.800">names </span><span begin="00:55.800" end="00:56.040">that </span><span begin="00:56.040" end="00:56.160">they </span><span begin="00:56.160" end="00:56.640">stick</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.790" end="01:00.240"><span begin="00:56.790" end="00:57.030">You're </span><span begin="00:57.030" end="00:57.540">never </span><span begin="00:57.540" end="00:58.110">gonna </span><span begin="00:58.110" end="00:58.560">fit </span><span begin="00:58.560" end="00:58.890">in </span><span begin="00:58.890" end="00:59.430">much</span><span begin="00:59.430" end="00:59.430">, </span><span begin="00:59.430" end="01:00.240">kid</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.080" end="01:03.150"><span begin="01:01.080" end="01:01.530">But </span><span begin="01:01.530" end="01:01.740">if </span><span begin="01:01.740" end="01:01.890">you're </span><span begin="01:01.890" end="01:02.640">troubled </span><span begin="01:02.640" end="01:02.820">and </span><span begin="01:02.820" end="01:03.150">hurt</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.300" end="01:05.340"><span begin="01:03.300" end="01:03.720">What </span><span begin="01:03.720" end="01:03.930">you </span><span begin="01:03.930" end="01:04.320">got </span><span begin="01:04.320" end="01:04.740">under </span><span begin="01:04.740" end="01:04.950">your </span><span begin="01:04.950" end="01:05.340">shirt</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.490" end="01:09.060"><span begin="01:05.490" end="01:05.820">We'll </span><span begin="01:05.820" end="01:06.150">make </span><span begin="01:06.150" end="01:06.360">them </span><span begin="01:06.360" end="01:06.660">pay </span><span begin="01:06.660" end="01:06.960">for </span><span begin="01:06.960" end="01:07.140">the </span><span begin="01:07.140" end="01:07.770">things </span><span begin="01:07.770" end="01:08.010">that </span><span begin="01:08.010" end="01:08.460">they </span><span begin="01:08.460" end="01:09.060">did</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.060" end="01:10.680"><span begin="01:09.060" end="01:09.480">They </span><span begin="01:09.480" end="01:10.530">say </span><span begin="01:10.530" end="01:10.680">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.680" end="01:14.280"><span begin="01:10.680" end="01:11.460">Teenagers </span><span begin="01:11.460" end="01:12.030">scare </span><span begin="01:12.030" end="01:12.300">the </span><span begin="01:12.300" end="01:13.230">living </span><span begin="01:13.230" end="01:13.230">*</span><span begin="01:13.230" end="01:13.230">*</span><span begin="01:13.230" end="01:13.230">*</span><span begin="01:13.230" end="01:13.230">* </span><span begin="01:13.230" end="01:13.680">outta </span><span begin="01:13.680" end="01:14.280">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.760" end="01:18.540"><span begin="01:14.760" end="01:15.240">They </span><span begin="01:15.240" end="01:15.510">could </span><span begin="01:15.510" end="01:15.810">care </span><span begin="01:15.810" end="01:16.410">less </span><span begin="01:16.410" end="01:16.650">as </span><span begin="01:16.650" end="01:16.950">long </span><span begin="01:16.950" end="01:17.100">as </span><span begin="01:17.100" end="01:17.910">someone'll </span><span begin="01:17.910" end="01:18.540">bleed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.660" end="01:20.610"><span begin="01:18.660" end="01:19.170">So </span><span begin="01:19.170" end="01:19.800">darken </span><span begin="01:1